#: crates/immich-mount/src/commands.rs:444
msgid "Immich Mount is not mounted"
msgstr "Immich Mount माउंट नहीं है"

#: crates/immich-mount/src/commands.rs:445
msgid "Mount it from Immich Mount, then open the link again."
msgstr "Immich Mount से ड्राइव को माउंट करें, फिर लिंक दोबारा खोलें।"

